# Pinned upstream OpenWrt release for the StartWRT image build.
#
# The release is fetched as the upstream tag tarball
# (https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/archive/refs/tags/v$OPENWRT_VERSION.tar.gz,
# overridable via OPENWRT_TARBALL_URL) and verified against
# OPENWRT_TARBALL_SHA256 before extraction — the integrity pin. For human
# reference: tag v25.12.6 == upstream commit 64900e756efa667774214f9c6b17c113222e01f7.
#
# To move to a new upstream release: update BOTH values (sha256 of the new
# tag's tarball) and copy the tag's feed commits into build/feeds.conf,
# then re-run `make start-wrt-openwrt-setup` — if a patch in openwrt-patches/
# no longer applies, refresh it per AGENTS.md "OpenWrt tree".
OPENWRT_VERSION=25.12.6
OPENWRT_TARBALL_SHA256=f5ff8258572a82df960470608ceb025655a42bc94b8e7e2a77a4373db46263d9
